{"4689350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Iron Dogs", "steam_appid": 4689350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>FLY THE OPEN SKIES</strong></u><br> <br>In Iron Dogs, take the helm of 1940's inspired aircraft in a colorful retro-inspired arcade flight-sim where you will blast hordes of enemy aircraft, naval vessels and more! Engage in dogfights (literally) with hostile aircraft, while flying through hand-crafted environments, find hidden secrets and keep your crew airborne by pillaging resources!      <br>    <br><strong><u>JOURNEY MODE </u></strong>   <br>    <br>Command your crew through environmental zones, evading hostile patrols, pillaging resources whenever possible to keep your zeppelin in the air. Recruit new crew members, ally with local factions, and fight back against a tyrannical government that seeks to wipe out all of the pirates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>UNLOCK AIRCRAFT, PILOTS, WEAPONS AND MORE</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-12 unique maps (Mountains, canyons, cities, and more!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-First Person Cockpit view </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-7+ enemy types (enemy aircraft, naval enemies, etc) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-8+ objectives (Like zeppelin defense &amp; train heists)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Unique &amp; dynamic Points of Interest for each map</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-9 Unique Pilots to join your crew with varied skillsets and bonuses to your aircraft</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-2 new Primary Weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-3 new Secondary Weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Full Crew Emblem customization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Pilot &amp; Crew name customization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Journey Mode (Single-player Story)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>UPGRADES!!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your ai